== A. synthetic errors: per-straddle cost (bits) of band-confined completions, coarse regime
   H = uniform in band (the record's honest law); HY* = exact w.p. 1-rho else uniform in band, best rho;
   SH = completion shaped like the error distribution (split sample).  local test: HY beats H near rho=1
   iff E ln(1+|e|/eps*) < 2 ln 2 - 1 = 0.3863
   sinusoid (pk=pi/2)                 pk= 1.57 | H 0.8854 (closed form 0.8854) | HY* 0.8854 at rho=1.000 | SH 0.8507 | E ln(1+|e|/eps*)=0.4731 -> no local gain
   peaked +-1 on 5% (pk=20)           pk=20.06 | H 0.4925 (closed form 0.4926) | HY* 0.1795 at rho=0.099 | SH 0.1977 | E ln(1+|e|/eps*)=0.0346 -> HY improves
   |e|~U[0,1], random sign (pk=2)     pk= 2.00 | H 0.7208 (closed form 0.7208) | HY* 0.7208 at rho=0.999 | SH 0.7198 | E ln(1+|e|/eps*)=0.3857 -> HY improves
   |e|~Beta(1,3), random sign (pk=4)  pk= 3.91 | H 0.5231 (closed form 0.5231) | HY* 0.4596 at rho=0.533 | SH 0.4213 | E ln(1+|e|/eps*)=0.2161 -> HY improves

